{"3165050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OUTCLAW", "steam_appid": 3165050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/3455e698f92ab16b0f0cfd51dac578dc.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1560 height=750 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the paws of Comet, a strange, five-eyed cat lost in a strange world. Collect and command chaotic feline shades that morph into ramps, bombs, and more to help you on your journey. Fight enemies, explore mystic worlds, and build your hub in a colorful third-person adventure.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUTE AND CHAOTIC HORDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and collect lost shades to join your family. On adventures, you can transform shades into a variety of objects and shapes to help you solve puzzles and problems. Over time, the shades will become part of a strange, found family as you seek a home among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/788f2c5f715e1019802553f001f0f7ba.poster.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/788f2c5f715e1019802553f001f0f7ba.webm?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/788f2c5f715e1019802553f001f0f7ba.mp4?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GALAXY OF GOODIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galaxy of collectible goodies await - your curiosity will be rewarded with keychains, unlockable customisation options for your hub and even snazzy little accessories for your minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/4255697becec5ec94eed43851f3268ec.poster.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/4255697becec5ec94eed43851f3268ec.webm?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/4255697becec5ec94eed43851f3268ec.mp4?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A GORGEOUS GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 12 unique levels with their own unique enemies and giant bosses to defeat! A starry and surreal universe is waiting for you to discover its secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/e2618754c49301d066722338bf50874c.poster.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/e2618754c49301d066722338bf50874c.webm?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/e2618754c49301d066722338bf50874c.mp4?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT US</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there! We’re Moss Monkey, a UK-based team formed from a shared passion for making games with immersive worlds to explore, strong aesthetics and adorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/2dc374e717023577b1973d9f40b3355d.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1488 height=1494 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the paws of Comet, a strange, five-eyed cat lost in a strange world. Collect and command chaotic feline shades that morph into ramps, bombs, and more to help you on your journey. Fight enemies, explore mystic worlds, and build your hub in a colorful third-person adventure.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUTE AND CHAOTIC HORDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and collect lost shades to join your family. On adventures, you can transform shades into a variety of objects and shapes to help you solve puzzles and problems. Over time, the shades will become part of a strange, found family as you seek a home among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/788f2c5f715e1019802553f001f0f7ba.poster.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/788f2c5f715e1019802553f001f0f7ba.webm?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/788f2c5f715e1019802553f001f0f7ba.mp4?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GALAXY OF GOODIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galaxy of collectible goodies await - your curiosity will be rewarded with keychains, unlockable customisation options for your hub and even snazzy little accessories for your minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/4255697becec5ec94eed43851f3268ec.poster.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/4255697becec5ec94eed43851f3268ec.webm?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/4255697becec5ec94eed43851f3268ec.mp4?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A GORGEOUS GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 12 unique levels with their own unique enemies and giant bosses to defeat! A starry and surreal universe is waiting for you to discover its secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/e2618754c49301d066722338bf50874c.poster.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/e2618754c49301d066722338bf50874c.webm?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/e2618754c49301d066722338bf50874c.mp4?t=1786461381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT US</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there! We’re Moss Monkey, a UK-based team formed from a shared passion for making games with immersive worlds to explore, strong aesthetics and adorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/2dc374e717023577b1973d9f40b3355d.avif?t=1786461381\" width=1488 height=1494 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Collect and command a horde of misch